<Base title="All Embedded Engineering Tools" description="Browse free UART, CAN bus, and STM32 timer calculators for embedded systems engineering."><Head eyebrow="Tool directory" title="All engineering calculators" intro="Focused tools for communication timing, network capacity, and microcontroller timers. Calculations run locally and expose their formulas."/><section class="container content"><div class="grid"><ToolCard href="/tools/uart-transmission-time/" label="UART" title="UART Transmission Time Calculator" text="Frame time, total bits, and payload throughput."/><ToolCard href="/tools/can-bus-load/" label="Classical CAN" title="CAN Bus Load Calculator" text="Standard and extended identifiers with two stuffing assumptions."/><ToolCard href="/tools/stm32-timer-pwm/" label="STM32" title="Timer and PWM Calculator" text="Register validation and target-frequency solving."/></div><section class="prose"><h2>What these tools are for</h2><p>Use these calculators during architecture work, firmware bring-up, lab troubleshooting, or study. They are deliberately narrow: each tool states the units, equations, and simplifying assumptions needed to interpret its output.</p><h2>What they do not replace</h2><p>A quick calculation cannot replace an oscilloscope trace, bus analyzer, clock-tree configuration, or the exact reference manual for your device. Treat results as a design aid and verify timing-sensitive or safety-relevant work.</p></section></section></Base>
